{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123477","id":4522145265,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDYp18Q","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123477","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123477.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123477.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123477","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123477/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123477/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123477/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/114dcee42b41919d4d22afab7aced335262fd172","number":123477,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Document that `AcceptDialog` buttons ignore `custom_minimum_size`","user":{"login":"mateuseap","id":52019009,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDE5MDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52019009?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateuseap","html_url":"https://github.com/mateuseap","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateuseap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateuseap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateuseap/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateuseap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateuseap/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateuseap/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateuseap/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateuseap/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mateuseap/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #123386\n\n#### Changes made\n\n- Documented on `AcceptDialog.get_ok_button()`, `AcceptDialog.add_button()`, `AcceptDialog.add_cancel_button()`, and `ConfirmationDialog.get_cancel_button()` that setting `Control.custom_minimum_size` on the returned button has no effect, and pointed to the `buttons_min_width` and `buttons_min_height` theme constants instead.\n- Documented on both theme constants that the dialog applies them to every button in the bottom row, overwriting the buttons' own `custom_minimum_size`.\n\n`AcceptDialog::_update_child_rects()` (`scene/gui/dialogs.cpp`) assigns `Size2(theme_cache.buttons_min_width, theme_cache.buttons_min_height)` to each button in the bottom row, and runs on visibility, size, theme, and button list changes, so any `custom_minimum_size` set by the user is reset. As noted in the issue this is intended behavior, so this PR only documents it.\n\nValidated with `misc/scripts/validate_xml.py` and `doc/tools/make_rst.py`, and checked the generated reStructuredText to confirm all `[member]` and `[theme_item]` references resolve, including the cross-class ones in `ConfirmationDialog`.\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url